{"resourceIdentifier":"3393","resourceName":"Hubei Jiulong PET Recycling Project","description":"Hubei Jiulong PET Recycling Project (hereafter referred to as “the Project”) aims to produce PET\r\nflakes by recycling and processing post-consumer PET bottles, to replace the same amount of \r\nPET products produced from raw materials. It is planned that 76,000 tons of post-consumer PET \r\nbottles per year will be recycled into 65,000 tons of PET flakes at maximum production capacity. \r\nLocated in Yunmeng County, Xiaogan City, Hubei Province, China, the Project is developed and \r\noperated by Hubei Jiulong Recycling Technology Co., Ltd. (hereafter referred to as “the project \r\nproponent”).\r\nPrior to the project implementation, the same amount of PET flakes was produced from raw\r\nmaterials (crude oil and natural gas); the baseline scenario is the same as the condition prior to \r\nproject initiation. The Project achieves GHG emission reductions by avoiding the consumption of \r\nthe equivalent raw materials and by reducing related energy consumption as well.\r\nIt is estimated that the Project will achieve annual GHG emission reductions of 58,067 tCO2e and \r\nthe total emission reductions of 406,469 tCO2e over the first crediting period.","location":{"latitude":31.004567,"longitude":113.794261},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-10-20","endExclusive":"2022-11-20","endInclusive":"2022-11-19"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3393"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hubei"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Hubei Jiulong Recycling Technology Co., Ltd."},{"type":"string","value":"Hubei Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3393"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"58092"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.AJ."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"21/06/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 02/03/2021 - 01/03/2028"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=69652&IDKEY=olksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098a96050108","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"2022.06.30__Jiulong__VCS__PD__clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-07-11T01:14:44.82Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=69653&IDKEY=0097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87d96051487","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Hubei_jiulong_Listing_Representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-07-11T01:18:13.17Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=92031&IDKEY=r903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdff126910749","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS3393_Joint PD-MR_v03_clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-06-21T06:35:58.003Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=85295&IDKEY=0097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87k117621805","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"08- jiulong registration representation.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-02-25T13:20:02.713Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=92032&IDKEY=k98kla